# Physics receipt: Density on the old page, through the panel. Its signature
# is room following mass (the rank of mass against area share) and an even
# density, not energy (the flow writes positions). On the fixture the bar is
# qualitative (ruled 2026-10-03): from the boot start the rank rises above
# the start's and the density CV falls. Springs from the same start is the
# control (physics_density_control), and picking Density disables the
# overlays it refuses with the law's reason (it takes Hub room and Centre
# converted, F73).
assert title GRAPHSHELL H3 READY
assert snap ready == true
# The boot arrangement pauses the canvas, so the law is set and applied with
# nothing moving: its start is the boot layout, the control's too.
assert snap physics-paused == true
# An overlay ticked under Springs that Density refuses is disabled and
# unticked once Density is picked, so Density applies alone.
select #gs-physics-select spring.rapier
check #gs-overlay-grid-snap on
assert attr #gs-overlay-note hidden
select #gs-physics-select density.gastner-newman
settle 1
assert attr #gs-overlay-grid-snap disabled
assert dom #gs-overlay-note Density takes only Hub room and Centre
capture physics_density_refused
wait
dom click [data-command="apply-physics"]
settle 1
assert snap physics-law == density.gastner-newman
assert snap physics-profile == law.density
assert dom #gs-product-status Physics set to Density
assert snap physics-paused == true
log-layout density start
# No arrangement: the boot Spiral's anchor springs would pull under every
# law. Returning to none resumes the canvas.
select #gs-arrangement-select free
dom click [data-command="apply-arrangement"]
settle 1
assert snap layout == free
assert snap physics-paused == false
capture physics_density_start
settle 2
# Until the flow stops (60 passes at least, then three calm ones, the
# 120-pass cap behind them; one tick a frame here).
settle 7400
assert snap physics-continuous == false
capture physics_density_settled
# Framing (2026-10-04, "Density gets the check here"): every node's centre on
# the visible canvas at the frame this capture shows, after the settle.
assert snap layout-outside == 0
wait
log-layout density settled
assert snap layout-rank-rose == true
assert snap layout-cv-fell == true
assert snap layout-overlaps == 0
log physics density receipt complete
